  "description": "An ultra lightweight API for robust distributed application mutex locking capabilities leveraging Sql Server.  The API provides a set of easy to use custom extensions for the System.Data.SqlClient that provide robust distributed application mutex/locking support via the sp_getapplock & sp_releaseapplock stored procedures.",
  "id": "SqlAppLockHelper.SystemData",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-05-15T22:09:27.16Z",
